OL,3,ANew rain warning issued for England and
OL,4,AWales as Storm Boelo hits UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FFerry services in the Irish Sea are
OL,7,Fcancelled, and there are also
OL,8,Fcancellations on the CalMac service
OL,9,Faround the west coast of Scotland
OL,11,FOn Friday, Austen hit southern England,
OL,12,Fthe Channel Islands, and parts of Wales
OL,14,FTens of thousands of properties lost
OL,15,Fpower in south-west England - thousands
OL,16,Fare still waiting to be reconnected on
OL,17,FSaturday
